   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cards and messages",
     "texto": [
      "**Kartu ucapan** is a card to go with a congratulation or a wish. **Selamat menempuh hidup baru** is a formula of good wishes for a couple who are getting married.",
      "Context helps tell apart **ucapan** (\"words, message\") from **ucapan selamat** (\"congratulations\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prepositions in a greeting",
     "texto": [
      "**Kepada** shows who receives something; **untuk**, for whom or with what purpose; **atas**, the reason for the congratulation. These prepositions already appear at an earlier level, but here they are combined in longer messages."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
